  "body": "The specification uses the term \"[canonical case](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#limited-to-only-known-values)\" in three locations with regards to attribute reflection. While it can be deduced, it's not immediately clear what the canonical case is for a particular attribute since this phrase is not used elsewhere.\r\n\r\nI think it would be helpful if it could either be clarified or replaced with another defined concept, in case an appropriate one already exists.",
